                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much of Rs 25L skincare launch budget should go to branding?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 3-6L (12-24%). Under-investing in branding to allocate more to inventory or paid media is the most common Rs 25L launch mistake. Weak brand identity limits marketing effectiveness + compresses year-2 brand-search lift + repeat.</p>
                                        <h3>What does skincare branding cover?</h3>
                                        <p>Brand strategy + positioning + naming + logo + visual identity (palette + typography + iconography) + brand voice + tone + packaging design (apothecary / clinical / playful / premium modern / sensory luxury) + brand guidelines document + photography style guide + digital brand system.</p>
                                        <h3>How long does skincare branding take?</h3>
                                        <p>16-18 weeks for launch-ready brand identity + strategy + packaging + guidelines. Below 12 weeks = compressed depth. Phased delivery (discovery + strategy &rarr; naming &rarr; logo + identity &rarr; system extensions &rarr; packaging &rarr; guidelines + handoff).</p>
                                        <h3>What to look for in skincare branding agency portfolio?</h3>
                                        <p>Named skincare brands identified with live Shopify + Instagram inspection. Sub-vertical fit. Strategy depth (positioning workshops, not just execution). Cultural fluency. Packaging + physical + digital coordination. Founder + senior involvement.</p>
                                        <h3>Do we need packaging design for skincare branding?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes essential. Skincare unboxing critical brand moment. Full packaging: primary bottle + label + secondary box + insert card + tamper-evident + certificate + care card. Rs 100-500 per order packaging cost.</p>
                                        <h3>Should we hire branding agency separately or bundle with marketing?</h3>
                                        <p>Bundled with marketing + Shopify build preferred for launch. Continuity + brand-application consistency + no coordination overhead. Standalone branding-only agencies for well-established brands doing rebrand.</p>
                                        <h3>What is minimum viable branding investment?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 2-3L basic logo + palette + simple guidelines + template packaging. Weak but functional. Rs 3-8L full strategy + identity + packaging + guidelines. Rs 8-15L luxury + heritage + extensive style guide.</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD handle skincare branding?</h3>
                                        <p>2-week strategy + positioning workshop + naming + logo + visual identity + brand voice + packaging + guidelines + digital brand system + team training + ongoing brand stewardship. Bundled with Shopify + marketing retainer. See <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php">skincare vertical page</a>.</p>
